		{
			dependencies: ["23AA8BC5D26A4F47"]
			description: ["The Digester is a must-have for anyone looking to increase their bio-machine fuel efficiency. With it, you can turn food items into nutrient paste! Some non-food items can also be fed to the digester for nutrients, check JEI if you're interested."]
