		{
			dependencies: ["23AA8BC5D26A4F47"]
			description: ["The Bio-Lab is a bio machine used for making serums. Serums are like potions, but instead of drinking them, you inject them. There are a lot of different serums with different effects, so some quests have been made to show you how they are made and what they do."]
